# sre-terminal-trainer sshd configuration.
# Password login only, inside a throwaway container that is normally published
# on a loopback/host port. Never expose this port to an untrusted network.

Port 22
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0

PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
UsePAM no
UseDNS no

PrintMotd no
X11Forwarding no
MaxAuthTries 6
ClientAliveInterval 60

Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
